.claude/settings.json:545:        "_comment": "PLAN-125 WS-1 (kooky-harvest): per-tool-call lifecycle FAILURE coverage. Fires only on the rare tool-failure path (not the hot success path). Reuses check_output_secrets.py — it reads the native duration_ms + tool_use_id, pairs with the PreToolUse stamp, and emits tool_call_lifecycle_recorded with success=false (the PostToolUseFailure phase IS the success signal — no marker scan, MF-SEC). Routes through the dedicated scrub-branch + allowlist (NEVER _EMIT_GENERIC_PASSTHROUGH, MF-SEC-2); raw mcp__* tool name → mcp_other (MF-SEC-1); duration_bucket only, never raw ms (MF-SEC-3). Advisory + fail-open: a telemetry emit failure never blocks. Kill-switch CEO_TOOL_LIFECYCLE=0.",
